From 39b5c294709920aeba76cc9849725ef35edc269f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guild Idler Patch <patch@guild-idler.local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 05:40:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 5 new dog breeds to the general pet pool (Goldenpaw,
 Farwatch, Longshadow, Briarbeard, Frostrunner)

- 5 new plain (non-dedicatedOnly) pets.json entries -- Golden Retriever,
  Akita, Great Dane, Schnauzer, Siberian Husky, from the same licensed
  pack as the existing Saint Bernard/hatchery_hound. Joining
  GENERAL_PET_POOL automatically, no new drop-chance or weighting logic
  needed. hatchery_hound stays exactly as-is, still the_last_clutch's
  dedicated starter egg.
- 5 new PetSpec entries in tools/import_pets.py, same pre-cut-strip
  shape as the Hound (anim_files, 100x100 padded frame canvas, 10-frame
  idle + 8-frame run strips) -- confirmed directly against the real
  uploaded source files, not assumed. Recolor/keep palettes picked by
  actually sampling each PNG's colour histogram: Longshadow's harlequin
  base+patches recolor together as one cohesive palette so the coat
  pattern survives the hue shift; Frostrunner's genuine cyan eye colour
  is explicitly protected from the recolor the same way every other
  species keeps its eyes fixed while its coat tints.

Verified by actually running the real import pipeline against the real
source files (not just reasoning through the spec): correct manifest
entries for all 5 species, all 5 rarity tiers rendered correctly for
both animations with coats shifting hue while eyes/outlines stay fixed
(visually confirmed), and exact frame counts with no dropped/corrupted
frames. Separately confirmed at the data layer: GENERAL_PET_POOL and
pickHatchedPetDefId correctly surface all 5 new species from an ordinary
egg hatch across a large sample, while hatchery_hound/black_dragonling
remain correctly excluded. Full tsc --noEmit and vite build pass clean.

Art itself (public/pets/) is gitignored same as every other species and
isn't part of this patch -- generated separately and handed over
alongside it; run 'python3 tools/import_pets.py --src <raw sheets> --out
public/pets --only goldenpaw farwatch longshadow briarbeard frostrunner'
to regenerate locally, which merges onto the existing manifest without
touching the other 10 species' entries.
